# ==========================================================================
# .gitignore for the "Measuring Foreign Exposure" replication package
# Goal: keep the repository to CODE ONLY. Data are distributed separately
# (see the Data section of the README) and must never be committed, because
# (a) individual WIOD tables exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, and
# (b) WIOD/IMF data carry their own redistribution terms.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Raw and processed data (obtain separately; see README > Data) ---------
matlab/data/raw/**
matlab/data/processed/**
# ...but keep the empty folder scaffolding so users know where data goes:
!matlab/data/
!matlab/data/raw/
!matlab/data/raw/.gitkeep
!matlab/data/processed/
!matlab/data/processed/.gitkeep
!matlab/data/raw/IMF/
!matlab/data/raw/IMF/.gitkeep
!matlab/data/raw/WIOD/
!matlab/data/raw/WIOD/.gitkeep
!matlab/data/raw/WIOD/SEA16/
!matlab/data/raw/WIOD/SEA16/.gitkeep
!matlab/data/raw/WIOD/WIOT16/
!matlab/data/raw/WIOD/WIOT16/.gitkeep

# --- Large generated intermediate outputs (regenerated by the code) --------
matlab/output/*.txt          # multilateral.txt, bilateral.txt (bilateral.txt ~6.4 GB)
matlab/output/*.mat
*.mat                        # supplySimulation.mat, demandSimulation.mat, etc.
stata/**/*.dta
stata/**/open_countries.csv
stata/**/closed_countries.csv

# --- Packaged data archive (goes to Zenodo, never to git) ------------------
*.zip
foreignexposure_data.zip

# --- Journal PDF (copyright: do not redistribute) --------------------------
*.pdf
!stata/output/figures/*.pdf  # keep the replication output figures (they are ours)

# --- Superseded readme exports (README.md is canonical) --------------------
Readme.html
Readme.pdf

# --- Python virtual environment & caches -----------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*~
*.asv                        # MATLAB autosave
*.m~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
